  "about": "The decision and achievement tree's hand-written spine. `pnpm tree -- --write` renders it, with the side-quests derived from content/quests and content/goals, into docs/decision-tree.md. status: implemented nodes name a `flag` that the validator checks is set somewhere in the content (or by the engine, with engine: true); planned nodes are drawn dashed and are not checked yet. When you build one, flip it to implemented and name its flag.",
